      "writtenOn": "2026-02-09T09:32:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That or we follow @david.ostrovsky@gmail.com \u0027s suggestion in jgit: https://eclipse.gerrithub.io/c/eclipse-jgit/jgit/+/1230814. I have already talked with @matthias.sohn@gmail.com about it and he wanted to have a look at it.",
      "parentUuid": "30990771_678709a5",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 12,
